<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8" />
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
<title>Redbarn Ventures — Consulting, Holdings & Investments</title>
<meta name="description" content="Redbarn Ventures is a consulting, holding, and investment company that builds durable value across the businesses it advises, owns, and backs." />
<link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg" />
<meta name="theme-color" content="#9e2b25" />
<style>
:root{--barn-red:#9e2b25;--barn-red-dark:#7c211c;--barn-red-hover:#b8342d;--ink:#1c1815;--ink-soft:#3a332e;--muted:#6b625b;--cream:#faf7f2;--cream-2:#f3ede4;--line:#e6ddd1;--white:#fff;--font-serif:"Iowan Old Style","Palatino Linotype",Palatino,"Book Antiqua",Georgia,serif;--font-sans:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,"Segoe UI",Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;--maxw:1160px;--radius:12px;--shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(28,24,21,.04),0 12px 32px rgba(28,24,21,.06)}
*{box-sizing:border-box}html{scroll-behavior:smooth}
body{margin:0;font-family:var(--font-sans);color:var(--ink-soft);background:var(--cream);line-height:1.65;font-size:17px;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased}
h1,h2,h3,h4{font-family:var(--font-serif);color:var(--ink);line-height:1.15;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:-.01em;margin:0 0 .5em}
p{margin:0 0 1em}a{color:var(--barn-red);text-decoration:none}a:hover{color:var(--barn-red-hover)}
.container{width:100%;max-width:var(--maxw);margin:0 auto;padding:0 24px}
.eyebrow{display:inline-block;font-size:.78rem;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--barn-red);margin-bottom:1rem}
.section{padding:96px 0}.section--tight{padding:72px 0}.section--alt{background:var(--cream-2)}.section--dark{background:var(--ink);color:#d9d1c8}.section--dark h2,.section--dark h3{color:#fff}
.section-head{max-width:640px;margin-bottom:56px}.section-head h2{font-size:clamp(2rem,4vw,2.7rem)}.section-head p{color:var(--muted);font-size:1.08rem;margin-bottom:0}
.btn{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:.5rem;font-weight:600;font-size:.98rem;padding:.85rem 1.5rem;border-radius:999px;border:1px solid transparent;cursor:pointer;transition:all .18s}
.btn--primary{background:var(--barn-red);color:#fff}.btn--primary:hover{background:var(--barn-red-hover);color:#fff;transform:translateY(-1px)}
.btn--ghost{background:transparent;color:var(--ink);border-color:var(--line)}.btn--ghost:hover{border-color:var(--barn-red);color:var(--barn-red)}
.grid{display:grid;gap:28px}@media(min-width:720px){.grid-3{grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr)}.grid-2{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}}
/* header */
.site-header{position:sticky;top:0;z-index:100;background:rgba(250,247,242,.85);backdrop-filter:saturate(140%) blur(10px);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
.header-inner{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;height:72px}
.brand{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;color:var(--ink)}.brand-mark{color:var(--barn-red);display:inline-flex}
.brand-text{font-family:var(--font-serif);font-size:1.25rem;font-weight:500}.brand-text strong{font-weight:700;margin-left:2px}
.site-nav{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:30px}.site-nav>a{color:var(--ink-soft);font-weight:500;font-size:.98rem}.btn--sm{padding:.55rem 1.1rem;font-size:.9rem}
@media(max-width:820px){.site-nav a:not(.btn){display:none}}
/* hero */
.hero{position:relative;overflow:hidden;padding:clamp(72px,12vw,132px) 0 clamp(64px,9vw,104px)}
.hero-inner{position:relative;z-index:2}.hero-copy{max-width:780px}
.hero h1{font-size:clamp(2.4rem,6vw,4rem);letter-spacing:-.02em;margin-bottom:.6em}
.lead{font-size:clamp(1.1rem,2.2vw,1.32rem);color:var(--muted);max-width:620px}
.hero-cta{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:14px;margin:2rem 0 2.6rem}
.hero-meta{display:grid;gap:20px;grid-template-columns:1fr;border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding-top:26px;max-width:640px}
@media(min-width:640px){.hero-meta{grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr)}}
.hero-meta strong{display:block;font-family:var(--font-serif);color:var(--ink);font-size:1.05rem}.hero-meta span{color:var(--muted);font-size:.92rem}
.hero-glow{position:absolute;z-index:1;top:-30%;right:-10%;width:60vw;height:60vw;max-width:720px;max-height:720px;background:radial-gradient(circle,rgba(158,43,37,.14),rgba(158,43,37,0) 62%);pointer-events:none}
/* about */
.about-grid{display:grid;gap:32px;grid-template-columns:1fr}@media(min-width:860px){.about-grid{grid-template-columns:.9fr 1.1fr;gap:64px;align-items:start}}
.about-grid h2{font-size:clamp(1.9rem,3.6vw,2.6rem)}.about-body p{font-size:1.08rem;color:var(--ink-soft)}.about-body p:last-child{margin-bottom:0}
/* cards */
.card{background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--radius);padding:34px 30px;box-shadow:var(--shadow);transition:transform .2s,box-shadow .2s}
.card:hover{transform:translateY(-4px);box-shadow:0 18px 40px rgba(28,24,21,.1)}
.card-icon{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:48px;height:48px;border-radius:12px;background:rgba(158,43,37,.09);color:var(--barn-red);margin-bottom:18px}
.card-tag{display:inline-block;font-size:.75rem;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:600;color:var(--barn-red);margin-bottom:8px}
.card h3{font-size:1.32rem}.card p{color:var(--muted)}
.card-list{list-style:none;padding:0;margin:18px 0 0;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}
.card-list li{padding:9px 0 9px 24px;position:relative;font-size:.95rem;color:var(--ink-soft)}
.card-list li::before{content:"";position:absolute;left:2px;top:16px;width:9px;height:9px;border-right:2px solid var(--barn-red);border-bottom:2px solid var(--barn-red);transform:rotate(45deg)}
/* stats */
.stats-grid{display:grid;gap:32px;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);text-align:center}@media(min-width:800px){.stats-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr)}}
.stat-value{display:block;font-family:var(--font-serif);font-size:clamp(1.8rem,4vw,2.6rem);color:#fff;line-height:1;margin-bottom:10px}.stat-label{color:#b0a69b;font-size:.95rem}
/* values */
.value{display:flex;gap:18px;padding:26px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--radius);background:#fff}
.value-num{font-family:var(--font-serif);color:var(--barn-red);font-size:1.4rem;font-weight:700;flex:none}.value h3{font-size:1.2rem;margin-bottom:6px}.value p{color:var(--muted);margin:0;font-size:.98rem}
/* cta */
.cta-inner{max-width:680px;text-align:center;margin:0 auto}.cta-inner h2{font-size:clamp(2rem,4.5vw,3rem)}.cta-inner>p{color:var(--muted);font-size:1.1rem}
.cta-actions{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:14px;justify-content:center;margin-top:28px}
/* footer */
.site-footer{background:var(--ink);color:#b9afa4;padding:64px 0 28px}
.footer-grid{display:grid;gap:36px;grid-template-columns:1fr;padding-bottom:40px;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.08)}@media(min-width:760px){.footer-grid{grid-template-columns:2fr 1fr 1fr}}
.footer-brand .brand-text{color:#fff;font-size:1.35rem}.footer-brand p{margin-top:14px;max-width:380px;color:#9a9089}
.footer-col h4{color:#fff;font-size:.8rem;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:14px;font-family:var(--font-sans)}
.footer-col a{display:block;color:#b9afa4;padding:5px 0;font-size:.96rem}.footer-col a:hover{color:#fff}
.footer-base{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;justify-content:space-between;padding-top:22px;font-size:.85rem;color:#8a8078}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<header class="site-header"><div class="container header-inner">
  <a class="brand" href="#"><span class="brand-mark"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="26" height="26" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M3 10 12 4l9 6"/><path d="M5 10v10h14V10"/><path d="M12 20v-6"/><path d="M9 14h6"/></svg></span><span class="brand-text">Redbarn<strong>Ventures</strong></span></a>
  <nav class="site-nav"><a href="#about">About</a><a href="#divisions">What We Do</a><a href="#approach">Approach</a><a href="#contact">Contact</a><a class="btn btn--primary btn--sm" href="#contact">Get in touch</a></nav>
</div></header>
<main>
<section class="hero"><div class="container hero-inner"><div class="hero-copy">
  <span class="eyebrow">Consulting · Holdings · Investments</span>
  <h1>We build durable value across the businesses we advise, own, and back.</h1>
  <p class="lead">Redbarn Ventures brings consulting, long-term ownership, and investing under one roof — so the right idea, the right operators, and the right capital can finally work together.</p>
  <div class="hero-cta"><a class="btn btn--primary" href="#contact">Start a conversation</a><a class="btn btn--ghost" href="#divisions">See what we do</a></div>
  <div class="hero-meta"><div><strong>Consulting</strong><span>Advisory that moves the numbers</span></div><div><strong>Holdings</strong><span>Long-term ownership</span></div><div><strong>Investments</strong><span>Conviction-led capital</span></div></div>
</div></div><div class="hero-glow"></div></section>

<section class="section" id="about"><div class="container about-grid">
  <div><span class="eyebrow">About Redbarn</span><h2>One partner, three ways to create value.</h2></div>
  <div class="about-body"><p>Most firms do one thing: they advise, or they own, or they invest. Redbarn Ventures was built on the belief that the best outcomes happen when those disciplines sit together — where an insight from an advisory engagement can become a company we back, and where the businesses we own sharpen the advice we give.</p><p>We are operators first. That means we roll up our sleeves, take real ownership, and stay for the long haul. Whether we are consulting for a client, holding a company for the next decade, or investing in an ambitious founder, the goal is the same: build something that lasts.</p></div>
</div></section>

<section class="section section--alt" id="divisions"><div class="container">
  <div class="section-head"><span class="eyebrow">What we do</span><h2>Three divisions, one operating philosophy.</h2><p>Each part of Redbarn stands on its own — and each one makes the others stronger.</p></div>
  <div class="grid grid-3">
    <article class="card"><span class="card-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="24" height="24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="m15.5 8.5-2 5-5 2 2-5z"/></svg></span><span class="card-tag">Consulting</span><h3>Advisory that moves the numbers</h3><p>We work alongside founders and operators on strategy, operations, and growth — turning hard problems into decisions that show up in the results.</p><ul class="card-list"><li>Strategy &amp; market entry</li><li>Operational turnarounds</li><li>Capital &amp; deal structuring</li></ul></article>
    <article class="card"><span class="card-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="24" height="24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M4 21V6l8-3 8 3v15"/><path d="M9 21v-5h6v5"/><path d="M8 10h.01M12 10h.01M16 10h.01"/></svg></span><span class="card-tag">Holdings</span><h3>Owners, not landlords</h3><p>We acquire and hold businesses for the long term, backing strong teams with patient capital and hands-on support rather than a countdown to exit.</p><ul class="card-list"><li>Long-term ownership</li><li>Operator partnerships</li><li>Shared services &amp; scale</li></ul></article>
    <article class="card"><span class="card-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="24" height="24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M3 17l6-6 4 4 8-8"/><path d="M21 7h-5"/><path d="M21 7v5"/></svg></span><span class="card-tag">Investments</span><h3>Conviction over volume</h3><p>We invest in a focused set of companies where our capital, network, and operating experience compound the odds of an outsized outcome.</p><ul class="card-list"><li>Early &amp; growth stage</li><li>Founder-aligned terms</li><li>Follow-on support</li></ul></article>
  </div>
</div></section>

<section class="section--tight section--dark"><div class="container"><div class="stats-grid">
  <div class="stat"><span class="stat-value">3</span><span class="stat-label">Complementary divisions under one roof</span></div>
  <div class="stat"><span class="stat-value">Long-term</span><span class="stat-label">Hold horizon on the businesses we own</span></div>
  <div class="stat"><span class="stat-value">Hands-on</span><span class="stat-label">Operating support, not just a cheque</span></div>
  <div class="stat"><span class="stat-value">1:1</span><span class="stat-label">Partner-led on every engagement</span></div>
</div></div></section>

<section class="section" id="approach"><div class="container">
  <div class="section-head"><span class="eyebrow">Our approach</span><h2>What guides every decision we make.</h2><p>The principles below aren't posted on a wall — they are how we choose what to advise, own, and back.</p></div>
  <div class="grid grid-2">
    <div class="value"><span class="value-num">01</span><div><h3>Skin in the game</h3><p>We commit our own capital and time alongside the people we back. Aligned incentives are the starting point, not a talking point.</p></div></div>
    <div class="value"><span class="value-num">02</span><div><h3>Patient by design</h3><p>Compounding rewards patience. We measure success in durable value created, not in how quickly we can move on.</p></div></div>
    <div class="value"><span class="value-num">03</span><div><h3>Operators at heart</h3><p>We have built and run companies. That lens shapes how we advise, how we own, and how we invest.</p></div></div>
    <div class="value"><span class="value-num">04</span><div><h3>Plain dealing</h3><p>Clear terms, direct conversations, and no surprises. Trust is the only asset that appreciates in every market.</p></div></div>
  </div>
</div></section>

<section class="section" id="contact"><div class="container cta-inner">
  <span class="eyebrow">Get in touch</span><h2>Let's build something durable.</h2>
  <p>Whether you're a founder looking for capital, an owner considering a home for your business, or a team that needs a sharper strategy — we'd like to hear from you.</p>
  <div class="cta-actions"><a class="btn btn--primary" href="mailto:hello@redbarnventures.com">hello@redbarnventures.com</a><a class="btn btn--ghost" href="https://www.linkedin.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Connect on LinkedIn</a></div>
</div></section>
</main>
<footer class="site-footer"><div class="container footer-grid">
